  "notes": "The Food is the ruling R_FOOD's TokenSpec, copied exactly (MAPPER_GUIDE). The lifegain trigger (LifeGainedEvent you, your turn, ordinal 1) is the compiler's, kept. Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/cat_collector_food_gains_three_and_makes_a_cat.json, tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/cat_collector_only_the_first_life_gain_makes_cats.json."
